  m_text: 'When you click "REVERT" in the SETUP tab, the BepInEx folder, doorstop_config.ini,
    and winhttp.dll will be removed from the game directory.


    The "Clear all
    mods" option is enabled by default. If other mods that are not required for Archipelago
    are detected during the revert process, an additional confirmation prompt will
    appear asking whether you want to remove them.


    If you want to keep those
    mods, click "NO", then disable the option and run the revert again. If you want
    to remove everything, simply click "YES", and BepInEx will be completely removed.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
