  m_text: 'When you click "REVERT" in the SETUP tab, all the files that are downloaded
    by the setup will be removed from the game directory.


    Since the setup is
    replacing already existing folders, a .json file is created on setup to keep
    track of all additional files and it will delete them, restoring the game directory
    to its previous state.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba3e8b9dcf9de2d42a10ea892d87cb9d, type: 2}
